{"id":608,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"国際教養と文理融合を育む共学教育","feature_description":"鎌倉国際文理は、国際教養コースと総合文理コースを設ける共学校です。科学的教養の向上と優雅な性情の涵養を教育目標に掲げ、知識・学問と技芸・生活上の技術を理論と実践の両面から学びます。文理横断・文理融合の力を育て、徳育・知育・体育の調和、感謝と奉仕を大切にしながら国際社会で生きる力を培います。国際交流と探究的な学びを通じ、自ら考え表現する姿勢を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":11524,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11525,"name":"なぎなた部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11526,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11527,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11528,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11529,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11530,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11531,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11532,"name":"マーチングバンド部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11533,"name":"フェアリーコンソート部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11534,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11535,"name":"ESS（英語研究部）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kamakura-u-j.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11536,"name":"児童文化部","categor